   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\">\n  <li>An artist is selling children's crafts. Necklaces cost $2.25 each, and bracelets cost $1.50 per each. Select <strong>three</strong> combinations of necklaces and bracelets that the artist could sell for exactly $12.00</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li>5 necklaces and 1 bracelet</li>\n  <li>2 necklaces and 5 bracelets</li>\n  <li>3 necklaces and 3 bracelet</li>\n  <li>4 necklaces and 2 bracelets</li>\n  <li>3 necklaces and 5 bracelets</li>\n  <li>6 necklaces and no bracelets</li>\n  <li>No necklaces and 8 bracelets</li>\n</ol>",
